      "font size" : 11.955,
      "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
      "content" : "Theorem 3.1. Suppose f(z) = h(z) + g(z), is harmonic on Ω. Then f2, is harmonic on Ω if and only if either h or g is a constant on Ω.",
